#. column 9: Grade 2 Artisanal Skybuilders' Pterodactyl
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:30008:0:8"
msgid "One must take great care when attempting to catch one of these winged scalekin, as they may find themselves lifted from the ground. In such cases, it is normally best to let go of the rod, although the more absent-minded may find themselves clinging on for dear life for reasons that even they cannot comprehend.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide."
msgstr ""

