#. ja: 新生祭のガラス絵
#. de: Jahrestag-Glasgemälde
#. fr: fixé sous verre de la fête de la Commémoration
#. column 2: <i>The Sultana's Seven</i> panes
#. column 8: A faithful recreation of the stained glass artwork that adorned the main stage at Ul'dah's Rising festival. The historic moment when Nanamo Ul Namo and her seven most trusted followers confronted a baying crowd and restored peace to the city is captured in all its glory. For aesthetic reasons, however, the artist has wisely chosen not to include the angry mob.
